{"about_the_game":"Last Dawn is a short first-person exploration game set in the year 2082. While attempting to flee a dystopian city, your ship was shot down. You awake in a cold wasteland known as the Old World. You must find a way out, but be careful. You are not alone here.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284090/extras/ezgif.com-gif-maker.gif?t=1676311240\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIND THE TERMINALS</h2>You will have to find the five terminals and deactivate them to escape. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284090/extras/ezgif.com-gif-maker__1_.gif?t=1676311240\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HIDE</h2>You will be hunted by the city's android guards. Avoid being spotted and captured. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284090/extras/ezgif.com-gif-maker__2_.gif?t=1676311240\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RUN</h2>If you are spotted the guards will run after you and attempt to capture you. It's best to run and find another way around them. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284090/extras/ezgif.com-gif-maker__3_.gif?t=1676311240\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ESCAPE</h2>Once all five terminals are deactivated the door will open, allowing you to escape.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284090/extras/ezgif.com-gif-maker__4_.gif?t=1676311240\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2284090?t=1676311240","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1676311240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284090/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1676311240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse